  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Hailing from Sector 7, once known for its artisanal coffee, now just burnt ruins, 'Bean' grew up scavenging for tech scraps and DRIP. The constant loss of flockmates hardened him, leading him to seek retribution against those hoarding the precious resource.",
